import{_ as t,o as a,c as i,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const c=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 317 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Critique of Red-Dust Immortal: Vagueness of the Ultimate Realm","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 317 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Critique of Red-Dust Immortal: Vagueness of the Ultimate Realm","no":317,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Red-Dust Immortal","Ultimate Realm","Setting Vagueness","Law-First"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","17-Plane Transcendent Standards","97-Setting Contradiction Self-Check Table"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0317_模块2-遮天-红尘仙设定批判.md","filePath":"en/0317_模块2-遮天-红尘仙设定批判.md"}'),s={name:"en/0317_模块2-遮天-红尘仙设定批判.md"};function o(r,e,l,u,d,h){return a(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-317-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-critique-of-red-dust-immortal-vagueness-of-the-ultimate-realm" tabindex="-1">Entry 317 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Critique of Red-Dust Immortal: Vagueness of the Ultimate Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-317-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-critique-of-red-dust-immortal-vagueness-of-the-ultimate-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 317 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Critique of Red-Dust Immortal: Vagueness of the Ultimate Realm&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 30) | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 17, 97</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-an-unspeakable-highest-realm-equals-no-highest-realm" tabindex="-1">Introduction: An unspeakable highest realm equals no highest realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-an-unspeakable-highest-realm-equals-no-highest-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: An unspeakable highest realm equals no highest realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> requires setting self-consistency over plot convenience. This entry dissects Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; ultimate realm &quot;Red-Dust Immortal&quot; — as Ye Fan&#39;s final landing point, it should have been the book&#39;s clearest setting, but is precisely the vaguest: how strong is a Red-Dust Immortal, can it rise further, what distinguishes it from an emperor — all by plot need. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ultimate-realm vagueness&#39;s waste:</p><ul><li>Readers lack clear sense of &quot;where Ye Fan finally ended&quot;; the epic&#39;s endpoint feel diluted</li><li>Whether there is a realm above Red-Dust Immortal, the author is evasive, leaving the door for sequels</li><li>Ye Fan&#39;s &quot;same-tier&quot; relationship with Shi Hao and Chu Feng is unclear; readers repeatedly argue</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ultimate-realm vagueness&#39;s internal world-view regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Ceiling uncapped</strong>: whether there is a realm above Red-Dust Immortal, forever uncertain, equivalent to the ceiling being infinitely raiseable</li><li><strong>Historical comparison invalidated</strong>: who is stronger, an ancient emperor or a Red-Dust Immortal, cannot compare due to realm vagueness</li><li><strong>Ending deflates</strong>: readers followed tens of millions of words, finally do not know where the protagonist &quot;arrived&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Red-Dust Immortal&#39;s vagueness is essentially predation on the &quot;highest realm&quot; setting asset:</p><ul><li>The author made the ultimate realm a rubber stamp, as big as needed</li><li>Ye Fan as a Red-Dust Immortal, his combat power stretches by plot need, no statutory upper limit</li><li>This vagueness itself is a &quot;protagonist privilege&quot; — the highest need not obey rules</li></ul><p>Red-Dust Immortal vagueness also has a narratological consequence: it turns &quot;immortalization&quot; from a goal with a threshold into an adjective. Ye Fan becomes immortal in the Red Dust, but what does a Red-Dust Immortal actually mean? Immortality? Invincibility? Transcending worldly dust? Definition unclear, so &quot;immortalize&quot; becomes another way of saying &quot;very strong.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Origin Realm and Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm are clear because every realm has statutory assessment indicators and duty requirements — reaching Origin Realm, you are not only strong, you must bear cosmos-tier responsibility. A realm is an identity, even more a duty; a vague realm has only power, no duty.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Shrouding Red-Dust Immortal Vague</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Origin / Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Clear</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>How strong is unclear</td><td>Origin Realm = cosmos-tier, quantified threshold clear</td></tr><tr><td>Is there above vague</td><td>Nine realms capped, Multiverse Realm / Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm joined as appendices</td></tr><tr><td>Difference from emperor vague</td><td>Each realm&#39;s promotion has statutory steps</td></tr><tr><td>Combat power stretches by plot</td><td>Combat power law-anchored</td></tr><tr><td>Leaves door for sequels</td><td>Version-maintenance notes reserve no vagueness</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: list Red-Dust Immortal&#39;s &quot;abilities&quot; described across different chapters</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: observe whether these descriptions are consistent early and late</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: number of early-late contradiction points</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: conclusion — Red-Dust Immortal&#39;s ability descriptions fluctuate noticeably with plot, lacking stable definition, verifying the &quot;ultimate realm vagueness&quot; diagnosis</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency</strong>: low — ultimate realm lacks clear definition</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk</strong>: high — vagueness is leaving the door for retcon</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: medium — Ye Fan as Red-Dust Immortal, his combat-power vagueness serves his protagonist status</li></ul><p>Red-Dust Immortal vagueness also weakens the &quot;ultimate realm&quot; ritual feel. Readers followed tens of millions of words, expecting to see the protagonist reach a clear, insurmountable apex, after which the story can satisfactorily end. But Red-Dust Immortal&#39;s vagueness makes this endpoint like a step that never lands — readers lift their foot and step over, only to find fog ahead. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Origin Realm must be clear because it gives readers a &quot;arrived&quot; confirmation. The endpoint can continue to expand, but the current segment&#39;s endpoint must be solid.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: endpoint feel diluted, readers&#39; argument cost</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: making the highest realm a rubber stamp</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least caps at Fierce Realm with clear definition; Shrouding&#39;s Red-Dust Immortal is a &quot;capped cap&quot;</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: ultimate realm vague means Myriad Ranks do not know &quot;what the top looks like&quot;</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: unclear ultimate realm cannot serve as cross-multiverse baseline</li></ul><p>Red-Dust Immortal vagueness also causally interacts with the &quot;immortalization road&quot; zero-sum design. Precisely because immortalization quotas are limited, what a Red-Dust Immortal is must be vague — if stated clearly, quotas cannot be sold. Heng Yuan Zhou writing the ultimate realm clearly is precisely because it does not intend to make &quot;reaching the ultimate&quot; a scarce commodity. The realm is clear because it is open to Myriad Ranks.</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A story whose highest realm is unspeakable is like a race with no finish line — the audience ran tens of millions of steps, finally do not know whether they arrived. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Origin Realm and Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm must be clear numbers and thresholds, because once the endpoint is vague, all running loses meaning.</p><p>The ultimate realm unspeakable equals no ultimate realm. Readers followed tens of millions of words, finally do not know whether the protagonist arrived — this is fundamental betrayal of readers&#39; patience.</p><p>Red-Dust Immortal vagueness also relates to the &quot;leave for sequels&quot; commercial logic. State it clearly and cannot write sequels; keep it vague and can continue indefinitely. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s document system reserves no vagueness for sequels, but leaves appendices for the future — an appendix is a clear addition, not vague suspense. Clarity and sequels are not contradictory.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · Red-Dust Immortal setting critique described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./292_模块2-遮天-境界膨胀批判.html">Entry 292 · Realm Inflation Critique</a> · <a href="./309_模块2-遮天-境界体系替代.html">Entry 309 · Cultivation-Realm Alternative</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const g=t(s,[["render",o]]);export{c as __pageData,g as default};
